WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.310
"Yikes!" thought Tom.

2
00:00:05.311 --> 00:00:07.812
Crocodiles filled the moat.

3
00:00:07.813 --> 00:00:10.701
Some of the crocodiles were sleeping.

4
00:00:10.702 --> 00:00:14.451
Others were swimming in the water.

5
00:00:14.452 --> 00:00:18.176
Dirk clapped Tom hard on the shoulder.

6
00:00:18.177 --> 00:00:21.579
"Ack!" Tom cried.

7
00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:24.220
He started to fall toward the water.

8
00:00:24.221 --> 00:00:33.235
Dirk grabbed Tom's robe just in time.

9
00:00:33.236 --> 00:00:39.470
"Your silly net spell didn't work," Dirk said.

10
00:00:39.471 --> 00:00:44.777
"You better think of something else fast!"

11
00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:50.300
Tom gulped. "No problem!" he said.

12
00:00:50.301 --> 00:00:52.567
"I'll think of another spell!"

13
00:00:52.568 --> 00:01:01.083
Princess Mary started to cry again.

14
00:01:01.084 --> 00:01:03.016
"My royal crown!

15
00:01:03.017 --> 00:01:06.708
It's lost forever!"

16
00:01:06.709 --> 00:01:10.734
Tom wrung his hands.

17
00:01:10.735 --> 00:01:20.343
"What am I going to do?" he thought.

18
00:01:20.344 --> 00:01:24.557
Finally Tom just lifted his wand again.

19
00:01:24.558 --> 00:01:27.965
"Crown that is down!" he yelled.

20
00:01:27.966 --> 00:01:30.642
"Land in my hand!"

21
00:01:30.643 --> 00:01:32.994
Tom held out one hand.

22
00:01:32.995 --> 00:01:37.283
He stared hopefully into the dark water.

23
00:01:37.284 --> 00:01:39.840
"Whoa!" he cried.

24
00:01:39.841 --> 00:01:46.468
Everyone clapped as the crown started to rise.

25
00:01:46.469 --> 00:01:51.857
"Wow! Tom did it!" whispered a servant.

26
00:01:51.858 --> 00:01:55.557
"Hmpf!" Dirk said with a scowl.

27
00:01:55.558 --> 00:01:59.053
Princess Mary wiped away her tears.

28
00:01:59.054 --> 00:02:03.000
"Just one more second, everybody!" Tom called.

29
00:02:03.001 --> 00:02:06.082
He kept his hand over the moat.

30
00:02:06.083 --> 00:02:08.764
"Then I'll have the crown!"

31
00:02:08.765 --> 00:02:14.246
Suddenly Tom saw something else.

32
00:02:14.247 --> 00:02:19.175
"You idiot!" Dirk yelled.

33
00:02:19.176 --> 00:02:22.772
"Oops," Tom whispered.

34
00:02:22.773 --> 00:02:25.895
"Here comes the crown . . .

35
00:02:25.896 --> 00:02:34.090
On top of a hungry crocodile!"

